Cloud, talking about how

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:09.420
Google as the named leader from
the data security portfolio

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:14.460
vendors from 2019 report
increases your network

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:19.320
security in the cloud by
using three main ways.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:22.210
Of course, there are
other ways to do so.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:23.640
But those are the
three main ways

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:27.510
they go in depth on
the blog post, which

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:31.560
are securing your
internet-facing services,

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:34.560
secure VPC for
private deployment,

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:38.080
and micro-segment access to
your application and services.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.950
I think the latter one
is like what we "IIM."

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.850
So take a look and see how
you can make more secure

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.202
your deployments on the cloud.

00:03:46.202 --> 00:03:47.160
