00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:32.040
MICHAEL KLEINERMAN: Hi.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:33.450
Thank you for having me.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:36.750
Like you said, I'm a product
designer on the Google Cloud

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:37.830
Platform team.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:42.090
Before joining Cloud, I
worked on the Android and also

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:44.160
