00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:17.860
MICHAEL KLEINERMAN: Yes.

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.010
I had the opportunity
to touch design systems

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:22.900
since 2010 or 2011.

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:26.580
