00:32:26.890 --> 00:32:27.830
Everyone likes money.

00:32:27.830 --> 00:32:30.737
Nobody likes to spend time
wasting it doing nothing.

00:32:30.737 --> 00:32:32.570
I think everyone can
relate to this episode.

00:32:32.570 --> 00:32:33.470
It'll be very relatable.

00:32:33.470 --> 00:32:34.428
[LAUGHTER AND APPLAUSE]

00:32:34.428 --> 00:32:35.750
GABI FERRARA: Yeah, I think so.

00:32:35.750 --> 00:32:36.920
It's a nice one.

